msgstr "用法示例：："

#: ../../library/machine.WDT.rst:23
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "构造函数"

#: ../../library/machine.WDT.rst:27
msgid ""
"Create a WDT object and start it. ``timeout`` is given in milliseconds. Once"
" started the watchdog cannot be stopped; use :meth:`timeout_ms` to change "
"the window at runtime."
msgstr ""
"创建一个 WDT 对象并启动它。\\ ``timeout`` 以毫秒为单位给出。一旦启动，看门狗就无法停止；可使用 :meth:`timeout_ms`"
" 在运行时更改窗口。"

#: ../../library/machine.WDT.rst:32
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../library/machine.WDT.rst:36
msgid ""
"Feed the WDT to prevent it from resetting the system. The application should"
" place this call in a sensible place ensuring that the WDT is only fed after"
" verifying that everything is functioning correctly."
msgstr "喂 WDT 以防止其重置系统。应用程序应将此调用放在一个合理的位置，以确保仅在验证一切正常运行后才喂 WDT。"

#: ../../library/machine.WDT.rst:42
msgid ""
"Change the watchdog timeout to ``timeout`` milliseconds and reload the "
"counter. Useful when one of several states needs a longer-than-default "
"window before the next :meth:`feed`. The new timeout takes effect "
"immediately. STM32 only."
msgstr ""
"将看门狗超时更改为 ``timeout`` 毫秒并重新加载计数器。当多个状态之一在下一次 :meth:`feed` "
"之前需要比默认值更长的窗口时很有用。新的超时立即生效。仅限 STM32。"
